Test-only PKI for ark-net TLS/mTLS tests (ent-037/121/059). Generated with openssl; the CA
private key was discarded. None of these keys protect anything: they only sign "localhost",
"127.0.0.1" and spiffe://example.org/ark/node/n1 for loopback tests. other.* is a self-signed
client that no test CA trusts (negative tests).
